{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51839","headline":"云门寺 · 德圆","name":"云门寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"若耶溪边寺，幽胜绝尘嚣。\n一洞花将发，千岩雪未消。\n依阴生径竹，野色映溪桥。\n渐赏登高处，钟声应寂寥。\n（《古今图书集成·山川典》一一四《云门山部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"德圆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51839.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51839","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}